{"version": "https://jsonfeed.org/version/1", "title": "MiSTer FPGA Documentation (fork with editorial improvements)", "home_page_url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/", "feed_url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/feed_json_updated.json", "description": "MiSTer FPGA is an open source project that aims to recreate various classic computers, game consoles, and arcade machines, using modern hardware.", "icon": "assets/mister_kun_bw.svg", "authors": [{"name": "Kevin Coleman"}], "language": "en", "items": [{"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/rtc/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/rtc/", "title": "RTC Board", "content_html": "<p><img alt=\"MiSTer FPGA RTC Add-on board\" src=\"img/rtc1.jpg\"></p>\n<p>Some cores (ao486, Minimig) use a clock, so MiSTer provides them with the real time. When an Internet connecti...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/rtc.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T06:01:51+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/gb2p/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/gb2p/", "title": "Game Boy 2-Player", "content_html": "<h2>Game Boy 2-Player Demonstration</h2>\n<p>This is a demonstration of Game Boy link-cable play: two Game Boy cores run side by side, with the link cable connection ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/highlights/gb2p.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:58:56+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/cores/highlights/gb2p/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/cores/highlights/gb2p/", "title": "Game Boy 2\u4eba\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4", "content_html": "<h2>Game Boy 2\u4eba\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u306e\u30c7\u30e2\u30f3\u30b9\u30c8\u30ec\u30fc\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3</h2>\n<p>\u3053\u308c\u306f Game Boy \u306e\u30ea\u30f3\u30af\u30b1\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb\u5bfe\u6226\u306e\u30c7\u30e2\u3067\u3059\u30022\u3064\u306e Game Boy \u30b3\u30a2\u304c\u4e26\u5217\u306b\u52d5\u4f5c\u3057\u3001\u305d\u306e\u9593\u306e\u30ea\u30f3\u30af\u30b1\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb\u63a5\u7d9a\u3092\u30a8\u30df\u30e5\u30ec\u30fc\u30c8\u3059\u308b\u3053\u3068\u3067\u3001\u30de\u30eb\u30c1\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u304c\u53ef\u80fd\u306b\u306a\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<p><img alt=\"type:video\" src=\"videos/gb2p.mp4\"></p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/highlights/gb2p.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:58:56+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/faq/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/faq/", "title": "FAQ", "content_html": "<p>Answers to frequently asked questions about MiSTer. If something is missing, feel free to contribute by editing this page on GitHub with the Edit (pen) icon ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/faq.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:58:20+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/faq/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/faq/", "title": "\u3088\u304f\u3042\u308b\u8cea\u554f", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer \u306b\u3064\u3044\u3066\u3088\u304f\u3042\u308b\u8cea\u554f\u3078\u306e\u56de\u7b54\u3067\u3059\u3002\u4f55\u304b\u4e0d\u8db3\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308c\u3070\u3001\u53f3\u4e0a\u306e Edit\uff08\u30da\u30f3\uff09\u30a2\u30a4\u30b3\u30f3\u304b\u3089 GitHub \u4e0a\u3067\u3053\u306e\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u3092\u7de8\u96c6\u3057\u3066\u8ca2\u732e\u3057\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002</p>\n<h2>MiSTer \u306b\u3064\u3044\u3066</h2>\n<h3>MiSTer \u306e\u30bb\u30c3\u30c8\u30a2\u30c3\u30d7\u306f\u96e3\u3057\u3044\uff1f \u672c\u5f53\u306b\u3044\u3058\u304f\u308a\u56de\u3059\u306e\u304c\u597d\u304d\u306a\u6280\u8853\u8005\u5411\u3051\u306a\u306e\uff1f</h3>\n<p>\u3044\u3044\u3048\u3001\u3044\u3044\u3048\u3002\u3044\u3058...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/faq.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:58:20+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/debugging/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/debugging/", "title": "Debugging (USB Blaster)", "content_html": "<p>While developing a core, it's convenient to upload it through the USB Blaster (JTAG) port directly from Quartus. MiSTer supports USB Blaster and automaticall...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/debugging.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:57:42+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/developer/debugging/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/developer/debugging/", "title": "\u30c7\u30d0\u30c3\u30b0\uff08USB Blaster\uff09", "content_html": "<p>\u30b3\u30a2\u958b\u767a\u4e2d\u306f\u3001Quartus \u304b\u3089 USB Blaster\uff08JTAG\uff09\u30dd\u30fc\u30c8\u7d4c\u7531\u3067\u76f4\u63a5\u30a2\u30c3\u30d7\u30ed\u30fc\u30c9\u3059\u308b\u3068\u4fbf\u5229\u3067\u3059\u3002MiSTer \u306f USB Blaster \u306b\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3057\u3001\u30a2\u30c3\u30d7\u30ed\u30fc\u30c9\u3055\u308c\u305f\u30b3\u30a2\u7528\u306b Linux \u90e8\u5206\u3092\u81ea\u52d5\u7684\u306b\u518d\u8aad\u307f\u8fbc\u307f\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002Linux \u306f\u518d\u8d77\u52d5\u304c\u5fc5\u8981\u306a\u305f\u3081\uff08\u5b89\u5b9a\u6027\u5411\u4e0a\u306e\u305f\u3081\uff09\u3001\u8d77\u52d5\u6642\u9593\u304c\u9577\u304f\u306a\u308b\u306e\u306b...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/debugging.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:57:42+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/computer/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/computer/", "title": "Computer Core Networking", "content_html": "<h1>Computer core Internet and console connections</h1>\n<p>Since the May 7, 2018 release, MiSTer supports a serial (UART) connection from FPGA to Linux. Linux runs a ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/computer.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:57:15+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/computer/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/computer/", "title": "\u30b3\u30f3\u30d4\u30e5\u30fc\u30bf\u30fc\u30b3\u30a2\u306e\u30cd\u30c3\u30c8\u30ef\u30fc\u30af", "content_html": "<h1>\u30b3\u30f3\u30d4\u30e5\u30fc\u30bf\u30fc\u30b3\u30a2\u306e\u30a4\u30f3\u30bf\u30fc\u30cd\u30c3\u30c8\u30fb\u30b3\u30f3\u30bd\u30fc\u30eb\u63a5\u7d9a</h1>\n<p>2018\u5e745\u67087\u65e5\u306e\u30ea\u30ea\u30fc\u30b9\u4ee5\u964d\u3001MiSTer \u306f FPGA \u304b\u3089 Linux \u3078\u306e\u30b7\u30ea\u30a2\u30eb\uff08UART\uff09\u63a5\u7d9a\u306b\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002Linux \u306f\u3053\u306e\u63a5\u7d9a\u4e0a\u3067 PPP \u307e\u305f\u306f\u30b3\u30f3\u30bd\u30fc\u30eb\u30c7\u30fc\u30e2\u30f3\u3092\u52d5\u304b\u3057\u3001FPGA \u30b3\u30a2\u304b\u3089\u30a4\u30f3\u30bf\u30fc\u30cd\u30c3\u30c8\u3084 Linux \u30b7\u30a7\u30eb\u3078\u30a2\u30af...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/computer.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:57:15+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/ini/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/ini/", "title": "INI Settings", "content_html": "<p>The <a href=\"https://github.com/MiSTer-devel/Main_MiSTer/blob/master/MiSTer.ini\">MiSTer.ini configuration file</a>{target=_blank} contains global settings, and can also...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/ini.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:56:49+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/mgl/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/mgl/", "title": "MGL Files", "content_html": "<p>MGL files are shortcuts that load a game directly from the MiSTer Menu core. They can be placed in the root of the SD card to appear at the top of the menu, ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/mgl.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:56:49+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/ini/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/ini/", "title": "INI\u8a2d\u5b9a", "content_html": "<p><a href=\"https://github.com/MiSTer-devel/Main_MiSTer/blob/master/MiSTer.ini\">MiSTer.ini \u8a2d\u5b9a\u30d5\u30a1\u30a4\u30eb</a>{target=_blank}\u306b\u306f\u30b0\u30ed\u30fc\u30d0\u30eb\u8a2d\u5b9a\u304c\u3042\u308a\u3001\u30b3\u30a2\u56fa\u6709\u306e\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3082\u4fdd\u5b58\u3067\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3053\u306e\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u3067\u306f\u307e\u305a\u30b0\u30ed\u30fc\u30d0\u30eb\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3001\u6b21\u306b\u30b3\u30a2\u3054\u3068\u306e\u4e0a\u66f8\u304d...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/ini.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:56:49+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/mgl/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/mgl/", "title": "MGL\u30d5\u30a1\u30a4\u30eb", "content_html": "<p>MGL \u30d5\u30a1\u30a4\u30eb\u306f\u3001MiSTer \u306e Menu \u30b3\u30a2\u304b\u3089\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u3092\u76f4\u63a5\u8aad\u307f\u8fbc\u3080\u30b7\u30e7\u30fc\u30c8\u30ab\u30c3\u30c8\u3067\u3059\u3002SD \u30ab\u30fc\u30c9\u306e\u30eb\u30fc\u30c8\u306b\u7f6e\u3051\u3070\u30e1\u30cb\u30e5\u30fc\u6700\u4e0a\u90e8\u306b\u8868\u793a\u3055\u308c\u3001\u30a2\u30f3\u30c0\u30fc\u30b9\u30b3\u30a2\uff08<code>_</code>\uff09\u3067\u59cb\u307e\u308b\u30e1\u30cb\u30e5\u30fc\u30d5\u30a9\u30eb\u30c0\u30fc\u5185\u306b\u7f6e\u304f\u3053\u3068\u3082\u3067\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002\u30e1\u30cb\u30e5\u30fc\u30d5\u30a9\u30eb\u30c0\u30fc\u306f\u81ea\u5206\u3067\u4f5c\u308c\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<p>\u3059\u3079\u3066\u306e\u30b3\u30a2\u304c MGL \u30d5\u30a1\u30a4\u30eb\u306b\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308b\u308f\u3051...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/mgl.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:56:49+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/troubleshooting/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/troubleshooting/", "title": "Troubleshooting", "content_html": "<h2>The MiSTer FPGA's correct DIP switch configuration on the DE10-Nano</h2>\n<p>If your keyboard or other low-level hardware doesn't work, one or more of the DIP swi...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/troubleshooting.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:51:24+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/snes/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/snes/", "title": "SNES", "content_html": "<p>The Super Nintendo Entertainment System (SNES) MiSTer core has many features, such as CPU and Super FX turbo modes, lightgun and mouse support, and a configu...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/highlights/snes.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:51:24+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/video_freak/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/video_freak/", "title": "video_freak", "content_html": "<p><code>video_freak</code> is used to crop and scale the image.</p>\n<p><code>video_freak</code> takes the original <code>VGA_DE_IN</code> and outputs a new <code>VGA_DE</code> and <code>VIDEO_ARX</code>/<code>VIDEO_ARY</code> based...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/video_freak.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:51:24+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/troubleshooting/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/troubleshooting/", "title": "\u30c8\u30e9\u30d6\u30eb\u30b7\u30e5\u30fc\u30c6\u30a3\u30f3\u30b0", "content_html": "<h2>DE10-Nano \u4e0a\u306e MiSTer FPGA \u306e\u6b63\u3057\u3044 DIP \u30b9\u30a4\u30c3\u30c1\u8a2d\u5b9a</h2>\n<p>\u30ad\u30fc\u30dc\u30fc\u30c9\u306a\u3069\u306e\u4f4e\u30ec\u30d9\u30eb\u30cf\u30fc\u30c9\u30a6\u30a7\u30a2\u304c\u52d5\u304b\u306a\u3044\u5834\u5408\u3001DE10-Nano \u306e DIP \u30b9\u30a4\u30c3\u30c1\u304c1\u3064\u4ee5\u4e0a\u8aa4\u3063\u3066\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3055\u308c\u3066\u3044\u308b\u53ef\u80fd\u6027\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<h3>\u4e0a\u6bb5\u306e DIP \u30b9\u30a4\u30c3\u30c1</h3>\n<p>\u56f3\u306e\u3068\u304a\u308a\u306b\u306a\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308b\u304b\u78ba\u8a8d\u3057\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\uff1a ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/troubleshooting.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:51:24+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/cores/highlights/snes/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/cores/highlights/snes/", "title": "SNES", "content_html": "<p>Super Nintendo Entertainment System\uff08SNES\uff09\u306e MiSTer \u30b3\u30a2\u306b\u306f\u591a\u304f\u306e\u6a5f\u80fd\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002CPU \u3068 Super FX \u306e\u30bf\u30fc\u30dc\u30e2\u30fc\u30c9\u3001\u30e9\u30a4\u30c8\u30ac\u30f3\u30fb\u30de\u30a6\u30b9\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3001\u8a2d\u5b9a\u53ef\u80fd\u306a WRAM \u521d\u671f\u5316\u5024\u306a\u3069\u3067\u3059\u3002\u30ea\u30ea\u30fc\u30b9\u3055\u308c\u305f\u62e1\u5f35\u30c1\u30c3\u30d7\u306e\u307b\u307c\u3059\u3079\u3066\u306b\u3082\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3053\u306e\u975e\u5e38\u306b\u5f37\u529b\u306a\u30b3...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/highlights/snes.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:51:24+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/developer/video_freak/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/developer/video_freak/", "title": "video_freak", "content_html": "<p><code>video_freak</code> \u306f\u753b\u50cf\u306e\u30af\u30ed\u30c3\u30d7\u3068\u30b9\u30b1\u30fc\u30ea\u30f3\u30b0\u306b\u4f7f\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<p><code>video_freak</code> \u306f\u5143\u306e <code>VGA_DE_IN</code> \u3092\u53d7\u3051\u53d6\u308a\u3001\u30af\u30ed\u30c3\u30d4\u30f3\u30b0\u30d1\u30e9\u30e1\u30fc\u30bf\u30fc\u306b\u57fa\u3065\u3044\u3066\u65b0\u3057\u3044 <code>VGA_DE</code> \u3068 <code>VIDEO_ARX</code>/<code>VIDEO_ARY</code> \u3092\u51fa\u529b\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<p>```verilog\nmodule ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/video_freak.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:51:24+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/wifi/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/wifi/", "title": "WiFi", "content_html": "<p>WiFi is optional and simple to set up on the MiSTer. You'll need a compatible dongle, the <code>wifi.sh</code> script (provided with the Mr. Fusion image), and a keyboa...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/wifi.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:27:09+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}]}